[23.86, 24.44, "really"], [24.44, 24.88, "enjoyed"], [24.88, 25.14, "it."]]}, "listen": {"text": "Welcome! Is this your first time in Taipei? I opened this café three years ago. Many tourists come here, so I use English every day. If you like tea, you should try our oolong latte. It's popular because it isn't too sweet. How long are you staying here?", "wpm": 130, "src": "samples/7bce7112f932d891.m4a", "dur": 22.38, "w": [[0.0, 0.7, "Welcome!"], [1.28, 1.92, "Is"], [1.92, 2.16, "this"], [2.16, 2.38, "your"], [2.38, 2.7, "first"], [2.7, 2.94, "time"], [2.94, 3.2, "in"], [3.2, 3.6, "Taipei?"], [4.38, 5.06, "I"], [5.06, 5.5, "opened"], [5.5, 5.74, "this"], [5.74, 6.14, "cafe"], [6.14, 6.62, "three"], [6.62, 6.96, "years"], [6.96, 7.3, "ago."], [7.84, 8.46, "Many"], [8.46, 9.02, "tourists"], [9.02, 9.42, "come"], [9.42, 9.68, "here,"], [9.88, 10.02, "so"], [10.02, 10.38, "I"], [10.38, 10.6, "use"], [10.6, 11.02, "English"], [11.02, 11.48, "every"], [11.48, 11.82, "day."], [12.58, 13.26, "If"], [13.26, 13.44, "you"], [13.44, 13.74, "like"], [13.74, 14.1, "tea,"], [14.42, 14.74, "you"], [14.74, 14.94, "should"], [14.94, 15.18, "try"], [15.18, 15.44, "our"], [15.44, 15.96, "oolong"], [15.96, 16.32, "latte."], [16.78, 17.46, "It's"], [17.46, 17.9, "popular"], [17.9, 18.28, "because"], [18.28, 18.56, "it"], [18.56, 18.82, "isn't"], [18.82, 19.0, "too"], [19.0, 19.38, "sweet."], [19.96, 20.64, "How"], [20.64, 20.88, "long"], [20.88, 21.02, "are"], [21.02, 21.14, "you"], [21.14, 21.44, "staying"], [21.44, 21.78, "here?"]]}}, {"eiken": "英検2級", "cefr": "B1", "tag": "仕事の話ができる", "speak": {"text": "Hi, I'm Yuki. I work for a small company in Fukuoka, and I'm trying to build a career where I can work with people overseas. Last month I visited Taiwan and had a long conversation with a café owner about how she started her business. What impressed me most was how quickly she made decisions, and I'd like to bring that mindset back to my own work.", "wpm": 140, "src": "samples/096e6d8b4967eaad.m4a", "dur": 28.94, "w": [[0.0, 0.64, "Hi,"], [0.92, 1.32, "I'm"], [1.32, 1.7, "Yuki."], [1.96, 2.52, "I"], [2.52, 2.86, "work"], [2.86, 3.08, "for"], [3.08, 3.24, "a"], [3.24, 3.54, "small"], [3.54, 4.06, "company"], [4.06, 4.4, "in"], [4.4, 5.08, "Fukuoka,"], [5.36, 5.96, "and"], [5.96, 6.24, "I'm"], [6.24, 6.54, "trying"], [6.54, 6.72, "to"], [6.72, 6.92, "build"], [6.92, 7.1, "a"], [7.1, 7.52, "career"], [7.52, 7.92, "where"], [7.92, 8.14, "I"], [8.14, 8.36, "can"], [8.36, 8.62, "work"], [8.62, 8.82, "with"], [8.82, 9.18, "people"], [9.18, 9.74, "overseas."], [10.54, 11.26, "Last"], [11.26, 11.58, "month,"], [11.74, 11.8, "I"], [11.8, 12.24, "visited"], [12.24, 12.8, "Taiwan"], [12.8, 13.46, "and"], [13.46, 13.96, "had"], [13.96, 14.14, "a"], [14.14, 14.64, "long"], [14.64, 15.5, "conversation"], [15.5, 15.9, "with"], [15.9, 16.04, "a"], [16.04, 16.44, "cafe"], [16.44, 16.9, "owner"], [16.9, 17.74, "about"], [17.74, 18.12, "how"], [18.12, 18.38, "she"], [18.38, 18.76, "started"], [18.76, 18.98, "her"], [18.98, 19.36, "business."], [19.92, 20.64, "What"], [20.64, 21.08, "impressed"], [21.08, 21.32, "me"], [21.32, 21.7, "most"], [21.7, 22.06, "was"], [22.06, 22.32, "how"], [22.32, 22.98, "quickly"], [22.98, 23.32, "she"], [23.32, 23.6, "made"], [23.6, 24.12, "decisions,"], [24.12, 25.14, "and"], [25.14, 25.56, "I'd"], [25.56, 25.7, "like"], [25.7, 25.84, "to"], [25.84, 26.06, "bring"], [26.06, 26.32, "that"], [26.32, 26.8, "mindset"], [26.8, 27.16, "back"], [27.16, 27.36, "to"], [27.36, 27.54, "my"], [27.54, 27.74, "own"], [27.74, 28.1, "work."]]}, "listen": {"text": "Oh, you're from Fukuoka? I've been there twice for business, actually. I used to work for a trading company before I opened this place, so I traveled a lot. Running my own café is much harder than I expected, but I love meeting people like you. What brings you to Taiwan this time?", "wpm": 150, "src": "samples/dceb0e903d5d664d.m4a", "dur": 21.44, "w": [[0.0, 0.38, "Oh,"], [0.6, 0.9, "you're"],